### Why this design kills it:
*   **The SVG Filter (`feTurbulence`):** This applies a thick, calculated sheet of static grain *over* your photo and neon blocks. It unites the visual elements into one crushed, analog-feeling image.
*   **`mix-blend-mode: color-dodge` & `overlay`:** We literally force the neon pink and cyan blocks to burn into the highlights of the dark photo underneath them instead of just sitting flat on top.
*   **`-webkit-text-stroke` over Block Text:** One massive word filled with Toxic Yellow, and the overlapping word rendered as transparent outlines with an electric cyan border. It clangs together violently and beautiful.

**Do not tone this down.** Lock your photo in, change the copy to match the gig, and blast it out into the world. Commit to the grit! Take the risk—bold design is the only thing that gets noticed online today.

