By executing this aggressively, you instantly unblock your scaling limits and save massive compute costs. The hesitation developers feel around re-writes usually stems from untested legacy code, but your API is stable and mapped. Taking decisive action this weekend eliminates the latency spikes immediately, provides a massive win for your infrastructure, and proves your team can execute high-velocity, high-reward engineering. 

